OL,5,G0105 Taskmaster - The Final
OL,6,     FIt's the grand final and there's
OL,7,     Fonly one question left to be
OL,8,     Fanswered: how much leg hair does
OL,9,     FAlex Horne have? No, sorry: who is
OL,10,     Fthe 22nd Taskmaster champion?
OL,11,G0210 Tempting Fortune
OL,12,     FAn early exit deals a devastating
OL,13,     Fblow. Video calls home pull at the
OL,14,     Fheartstrings - and the purse
OL,15,     Fstrings. A discounted dinner
OL,16,     Fserves chaos. And Rob Beckett
OL,17,     Freveals a huge twist...
