OL,5,G0310 Location, Location, Location
OL,6,     FWe're back with Ros and Hannah who
OL,7,     Ffound their dream place in London
OL,8,     Fin 2019: are they still there? And
OL,9,     Fwe see how Joanna and Steve's
OL,10,     Fbeautiful home has grown with
OL,11,     Ftheir family.
OL,12,G0405 The Dog House
OL,13,     FCan super-friendly beagle Zoe
OL,14,     Fcharm Venessa and Jacob? Stanley
OL,15,     Fthe Staffie meets dog-mad Linda
OL,16,     Fand Richard. And is Ellie the
OL,17,     FChihuahua not fluffy enough?
